The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

generalized_stokes1

 Generalized Stokes problem on a unit square. Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Varying viscosity eta using a function.

generalized_stokes2

 Generalized Stokes problem on a unit square. Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Varying viscosity eta using a separate element to fill the Gauss
 point values of eta.

generalized_stokes3

 Generalized Stokes problem on a unit square. Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Varying viscosity eta using a separate element to fill the Gauss
 point values of eta according to a generalized Newtonian model.
 Picard iteration.

generalized_stokes4

 Generalized Stokes problem on a unit square. Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Varying viscosity eta using a separate element to fill the Gauss
 point values of eta according to a regularized Bingham model.
 Picard iteration.
